Sableclutch Scrap is a scrapyard in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], run by [[Copperjaw]]. Heaps of scrap fill the yard, and a great crusher flattens old vehicles while a crane swings over the piles. Copperjaw keeps an office in a converted storage container near the gate.

Copperjaw takes on hands directly rather than through an agency, so couriers and guards come to him for work. He paid one group 100 gold to carry a locked metal case to the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Diamond District/index|Diamond District]], the case chained by one half of a magic handcuff to the wrist of whoever carried it, to be unlocked by a doorman on arrival. He warned them that a pair of strangers had been asking after that particular piece of hardware, and that they were likely to try to take it on the way.
